    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Expo 设在 Von Braun Center 附近，规模不算大，但流程很顺。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>走出 Expo，外面是 Big Spring Park，亨茨维尔市中心最核心的一块。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
