    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 40",
      "caption": "回程晚霞 · 3 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-041.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 41",
      "caption": "回程晚霞 · 4 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>车子再次从那枚大火箭旁边开过，它就那么高高立着，夜里看着特别亮。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我突然有点走神。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>也不知道这辈子，还有没有机会，真的参与一次这种级别的高科技玩意。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "零下起跑 · 东北大花袄上线",
      "label": "零下起跑"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛这天是真冷。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-042.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 42",
      "caption": "比赛日清晨开往起点 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-043.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 43",
      "caption": "东北大花袄赛前造型 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-044.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 44",
      "caption": "东北大花袄赛前造型 · 2 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-045.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 45",
      "caption": "赛前穿搭检查 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这个周末美国整体降温，我心里有数，提前准备了东北大花袄和一件旧毛衣，打算起跑后直接当扔衣。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Siqi 跑半马，出发时间晚一些，她先把我送到 Von Braun Center 附近的起点。车门一开，冷风直接往脸上拍，我当场清醒，又缩回车里，把一条跟秋裤差不多的紧身裤套上，再加了手套，才敢重新下车。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>起点这片全是“保暖流派”：帽子、面罩、手套一应俱全，大家冻得原地小幅抖动。国歌结束，全马 7 点准时起跑。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-046.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 46",
      "caption": "起点与前半程 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-047.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 47",
      "caption": "起点人群 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-048.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 48",
      "caption": "国歌后的起跑队伍 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-049.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 49",
      "caption": "清晨第一波跑者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-050.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 50",
      "caption": "市中心起跑线 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-051.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 51",
      "caption": "起点与前半程 · 6 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-052.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 52",
      "caption": "起点与前半程 · 7 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>前几英里跑在社区里，天刚亮，街道安静。有人穿着垃圾袋，有人直接圣诞老人全套，美国跑马一向随意，这种松弛感，和我刚从国内回来的状态形成了很强的反差。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-053.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 53",
      "caption": "早段街区 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-054.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 54",
      "caption": "圣诞老人跑者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-055.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 55",
      "caption": "晨光里的街区 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-056.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 56",
      "caption": "红叶下的跑者 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-057.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 57",
      "caption": "节日装饰路段 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-058.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 58",
      "caption": "蓝天里的前半程 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-059.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 59",
      "caption": "早段街区 · 7 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-060.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 60",
      "caption": "早段街区 · 8 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-061.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 61",
      "caption": "早段街区 · 9 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-062.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 62",
      "caption": "早段街区 · 10 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我本来计划早点扔衣服，结果一路冷风吹。一直跑到 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">10 英里</span> 才把大花袄脱掉。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-063.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 63",
      "caption": "10 英里后摘掉大花袄 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-064.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 64",
      "caption": "赛道上的节日 cosplay @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-065.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 65",
      "caption": "赛道上的节日 cosplay · 2 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "最冷一段 · 迎风跑向大火箭",
      "label": "迎风而跑"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>蓝色毛衣战袍登场。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>其实也不是刻意秀造型，就是天太冷了，得穿点厚的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这段路线很长一段都在居民区里，小房子、小院子、特别安静。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>大家跑得都挺松弛，不追也不卷。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这几年跑下来，我自己也越来越佛系了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>耳机里放的是迟子建写的《额尔古纳河右岸》。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>正好听到一句：</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>&gt; 冬日的阳光，无论多么绚烂和明媚，都给人一种很清冷的感觉。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>&gt;</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>特别应景。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这天的阿拉巴马就是这样，太阳很好，但一点都不暖。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>补给点偶尔会冒出来几个 cos 志愿者。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>有公主，有巫婆，还有点说不上来是啥的角色。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>半程我用了两个多小时，差不多跑到 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">14 英里</span>左右，进入了一片铁路沿线的工业区域。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-066.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 66",
      "caption": "铁路工业区旁的赛道 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这里靠近 West Huntsville，能看到货运铁轨和老火车头，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这也是亨茨维尔以前工业和军工发展的老底子。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>穿过这片区域，又绕回一些居民区，接着就开始往航天中心方向跑了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>目标很明确，U.S. Space &amp; Rocket Center。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这一段是真不好受。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>风特别大，迎面吹。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>早上 9 点左右，体感比刚起跑时还冷，听说有零下十度左右。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我这个在外漂久了的东北人，居然还有点不适应。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>补给点也不多，身体慢慢凉下来，我就干脆切换成跑跑走走模式。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>结果越走越冷，只能赶紧再跑起来。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>终于，在 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">19 英里</span>左右，跑进了航天中心范围。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-067.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 67",
      "caption": "跑进火箭中心路段 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-068.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 68",
      "caption": "远处的大火箭 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-069.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 69",
      "caption": "火箭中心折返 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-070.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 70",
      "caption": "航天飞机旁跑过 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-071.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 71",
      "caption": "火箭路段蓝天 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-072.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 72",
      "caption": "跑进火箭中心路段 · 6 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这里一下子就不一样了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>有补给点，有摄影师，还有人声。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我在这儿补了点能量，也算是缓过一口气。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>航天中心这一段是折返路线，转身之后，正好是顺光。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>太阳打在身上，风也没那么扎了，感觉一下子回来了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>从航天中心出来，靠近 Huntsville Botanical Garden，我看到了 Siqi。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-073.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 73",
      "caption": "植物园附近的后半程 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-074.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 74",
      "caption": "植物园边的小溪 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-075.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 75",
      "caption": "后半程晒太阳 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-076.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 76",
      "caption": "蓝衣后半程 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-077.webp",
