    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-078.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 78",
      "caption": "植物园附近的后半程 · 6 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-079.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 79",
      "caption": "植物园附近的后半程 · 7 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-080.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 80",
      "caption": "植物园附近的后半程 · 8 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-081.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 81",
      "caption": "植物园附近的后半程 · 9 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>她状态看着还不错，穿得也很厚实。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这时候身体已经热起来了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我把蓝色毛衣脱掉，准备亮出最后的造型。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>阿森纳海洋配色登场。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这件球衣我找了挺久，最后才淘到。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>必须拿出来亮个像。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "室内冲线 · 路村好朋友相聚",
      "label": "室内终点"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最后 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">6 英里</span>，太阳正好照在脸上，体感比想象中暖不少。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这一段路线会经过 亨茨维尔植物园（Huntsville Botanical Garden）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>园区边上已经能看到不少圣诞装饰，晚上亮灯的话，应该会更有气氛。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>过了 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">22 英里</span> 之后，路线慢慢往市中心收。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-082.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 82",
      "caption": "22 英里牌 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这基本就是 downtown Huntsville 了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>街道上人不多，但路口都有警察在维持秩序。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这么冷的天，他们一直站在路边，很感激。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>路边还能看到流浪汉的帐篷。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>零下的天气，露宿在街头，真的有点不敢细想。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>很快，路线又回到了熟悉的地方。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>圣诞装饰、河道，还有那片市中心的绿地：Big Spring Park。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-083.webp",
