    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这时候就知道，终点真的不远了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>没想到的是，最后的冲线居然是在室内。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-095.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 95",
      "caption": "室内终点 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-096.webp",
      "alt": "室内终点拱门 · 赛事官方",
      "caption": "室内终点拱门 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-097.webp",
      "alt": "冲线瞬间 · 赛事官方",
      "caption": "冲线瞬间 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>直接跑进 Von Braun Center，一下子就挡住了风。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>不用再顶着冷风跑，整个人都温暖起来。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>终点的奖牌很有火箭城特色。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>正中是一枚大火箭，造型很立体，配色偏复古，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>下面刻着 26.2，方方整整的，很理工。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>完赛区有吃的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>鸡肉、汤，还有一些热乎的东西。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑的时候我还在想，要是能来只烤鸡就好了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>没走多远，我就被 Jackie 和 Scott 一眼认出来了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-098.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 98",
