      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-099.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 99",
      "caption": "完赛区递毛巾 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "../stories/chinese/Run50-Rocket-City-Marathon-clean_files/img-100.webp",
      "alt": "火箭城马拉松照片 100",
      "caption": "Scott 的赛后笑容 @Arsenan"
    },
    {
